  "details": "PreparingAssets is incorrectly logged as a value between 0.0000000% and 1.0000000% (0.00-1.00%), never as the full expected range 0-100%.\n\n1. Enable full output logs in VRChat settings.\n\n2. Join an instance and wait in a download screen of a large VRChat world (e.g. `wrld_529dbcdc-a5af-48bb-bc6c-edb42d7ab3ec`, Sailing ＆ Boating 2․0 by Shiro K, 715.05 MB). The total time spent downloading must take longer than 10 seconds (PreparingAssets).\n\n3. Check the output logs for PreparingAssets log lines. (`2026.04.02 21:23:18 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Preparation has taken 50 seconds, progress is 0.9206573%, loader state is PreparingAssets`)\n\nExpected behavior: The download progress is reported as a float value 0.0000000-1.0000000 (no percent sign) in the output logs, or alternatively as 0.00-100.00%.\n\nActual behavior: The download progress is reported as a float value 0.0000000-1.0000000**%** in the output logs, with the percent sign affixed. This may be confusing for the reader. It's reported as 0.00-100.00% in-app.",
